sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API as Payment API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Fraud as Fraud Checks
    participant Wallet as Wallet & Ledger
    participant Biller as Biller Adapter
    participant Notif as Notifications

    Customer->>API: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key, bill details)

    API->>DB: Check Idempotency Key

    alt Key already exists
        DB-->>API: Return existing payment result
        API-->>Customer: Return previous response
    else New Idempotency Key
        API->>DB: Save key and request details
        API->>Fraud: Check limits, velocity and block status
        Fraud-->>API: Fraud check passed

        API->>Wallet: Hold principal amount + fee
        Wallet->>DB: Record hold ledger entries
        DB-->>Wallet: Hold recorded
        Wallet-->>API: FundsHeld

        API->>Biller: Send payment request (10s timeout)

        alt Biller confirms payment
            Biller-->>API: Payment Confirmed
            API->>DB: Update payment status to Completed
            API->>Wallet: Finalize payment and record ledger entries
            Wallet-->>API: Transaction finalized
            API->>Notif: Emit PaymentCompleted event
            API-->>Customer: 200 OK (Payment Receipt)
            Notif-->>Customer: Send SMS and Push Notification

        else Biller refuses payment
            Biller-->>API: Payment Refused
            API->>DB: Update status to Failed
            API->>Wallet: Release held funds
            Wallet->>DB: Record release ledger entries
            API->>DB: Update status to Refunded
            API->>Notif: Emit PaymentFailed event
            API-->>Customer: Payment Failed
            Notif-->>Customer: Send failure notification

        else Timeout after 10 seconds
            API->>DB: Update status to Unknown
            Note over API,Wallet: Funds remain held
            API->>DB: Schedule status re-queries at 1, 5 and 15 minutes
            API-->>Customer: Payment Pending
        end
    end
